{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "latam", "appid": 553850, "month": "2025-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1756684800, "end_date": 1757375999, "month_true_total": 211, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:21:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "203902900", "author": {"steamid": "76561199033178872", "personaname": "EsElPedro", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ElVolaiTHO/", "num_games_owned": 214, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 20242, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 636, "playtime_at_review": 3251, "last_played": 1787873563, "avatar": "f92de68153c40be722e2d021e00acec4b0a731fb"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Arreglen su weá de juego", "timestamp_created": 1757364823, "timestamp_updated": 1757364823, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203902195", "author": {"steamid": "76561198108642257", "personaname": "AbusaMadres69", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/chilocabron/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 633, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 282, "last_played": 1765071591, "avatar": "702fbca4a499e282f768a8ecf279fa26ad591be0"}, "language": "latam", "review": "GOTY", "timestamp_created": 1757364022, "timestamp_updated": 1757364022, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203891985", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122225804", "personaname": "Ivangelion97", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198122225804/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 10450, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9154, "last_played": 1780107976, "avatar": "c61499f6cea6bce9cff329da6a9af139adddd5fc"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El rendimiento se fue de sábatico cariño, bugs de audio, crashes constantes", "timestamp_created": 1757354023, "timestamp_updated": 1757354023, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527559041976928711", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203890195", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095452915", "personaname": "Cerv", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Cervxz/", "num_games_owned": 124, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 15525, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 208, "playtime_at_review": 12820, "last_played": 1787514606, "avatar": "a5d9eb5593087c7479dce33aaca192a0e4a9227f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Algunos ven mi registro de servicio y leen \"213 horas\". Me preguntan si el juego es divertido, si \"vale la pena\". Qué equivocados están.\r\n\r\nNo entienden. Yo no he \"jugado\" durante 213 horas. Yo he servido.\r\n\r\nHe pasado 213 horas sintiendo el glorioso retroceso del 'Libertador' en mi hombro mientras defiendo un punto de extracción. He dedicado 213 horas a perfeccionar el arte de llamar a un Ataque de Águila justo en el centro de un nido de bichos repugnantes. He visto la luz de la Democracia Gestionada reflejada en el aceite derramado de innumerables Autómatas.\r\n\r\nMi armadura tiene cicatrices. Cada abolladura es un recuerdo de un Cargador que pensó que podía detener la libertad. Cada rasguño es un susurro de un cohete autómata que falló su objetivo. No son marcas de descuido, son el testimonio de 213 horas de estar exactamente donde tengo que estar: en la primera línea, empujando la oscuridad.\r\n\r\n¿Me canso? El cansancio es una forma de traición. Mi único combustible es una taza caliente de Liber-té y el conocimiento de que con cada planeta que libero, la Supertierra está más segura. Con cada misión, cumplo mi deber.\r\n\r\nEsto no es un juego. Es un llamado. Es el honor más grande. Esas 213 horas no son nada. Son solo el calentamiento. Mientras quede un enemigo de la humanidad en pie, mi Hellpod estará listo para el descenso.\r\n\r\nNos vemos en el infierno, enemigos de la democracia.\r\n\r\n¡POR LA LIBERTAD! ¡POR LA SUPERTIERRA!\r\n\r\n(Reseña aprobada por el ministerio de la verdad)", "timestamp_created": 1757352274, "timestamp_updated": 1757352274, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203883884", "author": {"steamid": "76561199787049593", "personaname": "NellSkull55", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199787049593/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 35555, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1298, "playtime_at_review": 8387, "last_played": 1788033370, "avatar": "34c118945bba2e506502542eb1faed5f3e761672"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Hasta el momento lo mejor de lo mejor, un juego distinto y muy entretenido.", "timestamp_created": 1757346352, "timestamp_updated": 1757346352, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"r